  // ── PHASE 5 / Workstream C (2026-06-01): Penalty ladder grace window ──
  // A cycle enters COLLECTING_GRACE when at least one ACTIVE member falls
  // short at the scheduled run time. The cycle holds here for exactly 24h
  // (SusuCycle.graceUntil) so the shorting member(s) can top up. On any
  // tick where every member has funded, the cycle finalizes (payout). At
  // grace expiry the still-short members are hard-defaulted (seizure +
  // 25% Voucher_Slash + future-payout strip + escrow) and the cycle
  // finalizes/defaults.
  COLLECTING_GRACE
  PAID_OUT
  DEFAULTED
}

